<title>USA: ARCO Chemical Co Q4 net dropped.</title>
<headline>ARCO Chemical Co Q4 net dropped.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN SQUARE, Pa. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Millions of Dollars except per share data)</p>
<p>					    Three Months  Twelve Months</p>
<p>						1996   1995   1996   1995</p>
<p> Total revenues			   $979   $993 $3,955 $4,282</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes	     20     55    139    248</p>
<p>   NET INCOME				 64    115    348    508</p>
